WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.294 --> 00:00:01.731
(moans)

00:00:01.731 --> 00:00:04.398
(intense music)

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.360
- I'm YB, and today we're doing
a Manuel Burrito challenge.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.757
They sent out an email at work,

00:00:13.757 --> 00:00:16.500
"Who wants to do it?" and all
my coworkers nominated me.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.750
And so here I am.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:18.650
- Hi, I'm Carlos.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:20.230
I'm gonna be making the
Manuel Special burrito.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.460
It's our biggest burrito
here at El Tepeyac.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.000
My grandfather Manuel came up with it.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.570
What the story is, is that Cal State,

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.240
when it had a football
team, long time ago,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.500
they wanted a really big
burrito for the full players,

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.130
and he had nothing on the menu.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.057
So what happened was, he
went to the back, he said,

00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:35.230
"No, I'm gonna cup 'em
with something real quick."

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.050
So he came up with this
burrito, the Manuel Special,

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:39.810
and it's been on the menu ever since.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.977
(giggles)

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.550
- Oh my.

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:46.460
This is the size of a baby.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.640
- [Woman] Three,

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.952
two,

00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:49.785
one.

00:00:49.785 --> 00:00:50.618
- Okay.

00:00:50.618 --> 00:00:52.993
I'm just gonna start from the corner.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.263
It doesn't even wrap
around the whole thing.

00:00:58.814 --> 00:00:59.647
Mm!

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.380
It's not gonna be a
classy eating challenge.

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.223
Get this giant bite.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:11.160
It's really good.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.483
It has a lotta rice.

00:01:13.483 --> 00:01:15.350
They put three scoops of rice in it,

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.530
and rice is usually what
makes you full first,

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.550
so that's gonna be the challenge.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:22.383
(edgy rock music)

00:01:28.423 --> 00:01:29.920
That's kinda like 1/3.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.560
I'm thinking if I should take a break,

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.150
but if I do I might get
fuller, so I don't know.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.560
I'm almost halfway.

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:37.430
Definitely getting harder.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.250
In the beginning, I was
just eating it really fast,

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.150
and now I'm slowing down a bit.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:43.510
I feel really gross right now.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:46.050
I just can't take more cheese and rice,

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.581
so we're gonna switch
over to my coworker Ken,

00:01:48.581 --> 00:01:52.710
(giggles) and he's going
to finish the burrito.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.580
- Now that I'm sitting down,

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:58.700
it's way bigger than I initially thought.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.130
I didn't eat lunch, so this is fine.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:01.230
This will be my lunch.

00:02:02.440 --> 00:02:05.913
And then what I'm gonna do is
I'm gonna work by sections.

00:02:09.347 --> 00:02:11.297
At this point, we just wanna finish it.

00:02:12.696 --> 00:02:15.863
(light, cheesy music)

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.713
- My hand is refusing to go to my mouth.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.070
We have ten minutes left.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.580
I think I'm gonna need to tap out.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.210
- It looks so much bigger
once you're on top of it,

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.300
but I only have like eight minutes.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.397
I eat rice, pork, and
guac on the regular, so.

00:02:40.389 --> 00:02:43.389
(strong rock music)

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.810
Trying to imagine that I'm really hungry.

00:03:04.436 --> 00:03:07.218
(buzzer sounds)

00:03:07.218 --> 00:03:08.322
(bell dings)

00:03:08.322 --> 00:03:09.910
Done.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.470
- We're all dying right now.
- Yep.

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:12.303
- Yeah.

00:03:12.303 --> 00:03:13.400
I don't feel like a winner.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:14.670
- [YB and Ken] But we finished.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.503
- Yeah, we finished it.
- Yeah.

00:03:15.503 --> 00:03:18.483
- So that's the most important part.

